WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:05.060
<i>But if you still want to sing then</i>

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.610
<i>If you want to bet all on living</i>

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:16.160
<i>The purity of your heart will destroy everything</i>

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:22.800
Mikumo generated bio-fold waves so 
powerful that they warped spacetime

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.940
and destroyed both the Protoculture 
structures and the original Voldorian ruins.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.670
The Windermereans then retreated.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:33.370
The army and the civilians were 
freed from their mind control.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:40.250
Two days have since passed, but we have had no further reports of the song of the wind.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:45.520
I suppose it's safe to assume that this particular part of the field covering the globular cluster has collapsed.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:51.480
That means capturing the Protoculture 
structures is the key to retaking the cluster.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.240
How are Mikumo and Hayate?

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.360
Still unconscious.

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:59.990
We know for sure that Hayate and Freyja resonated with each other again.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.290
However, that's all we know.

00:01:02.970 --> 00:01:05.050
What about Mikumo?

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:08.610
Did the medical team from HQ find anything?

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.250
Nothing.

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:14.880
There hasn't been a change since she was taken on board the medical vessel.

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:16.470
Any word from Lady M?

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:22.350
She's stubbornly silent regarding Mikumo.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:32.820
I don't like this at all.

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:34.960
Kumo-Kumo...

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.150
Freyja.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:47.980
Freyja!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:49.920
Mirage?

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:51.670
Ah.

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.090
Are you from Walküre and the Delta Platoon?

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:02.420
Who are you? This area is off-limits to non-personnel.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:07.990
I was here to resupply ammo and other goods, but got lost on my way out.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.560
I'll show you the way then.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.120
Thank you.

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:19.410
By the way, has Mikumo Guynemer 
regained consciousness?

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:24.330
Ah, pardon me. That was classified.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:26.290
Who are you?

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:32.330
I was watching as the situation 
got out of hand on Voldor.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:39.000
<i>Our kiss will send us leaping to the edge of space</i>

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.430
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:48.280
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:03.080
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:07.600
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.220
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:17.100
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:20.950
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:27.920
<i>By banging into each other, we confirm our uncovered love</i>

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:32.320
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:38.940
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:44.830
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.550
<i>Show me your passion, pray to the skies</i>

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:50.920
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:54.180
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:59.660
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:12.800
I am Berger Stone, the head of the 
Epsilon Foundation's Brisingr branch.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:20.320
The Epsilon Foundation? You're involved in thousands of companies across the galaxy.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.920
You have a hand in everything, from food to warfare.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:29.040
Indeed. The Windermere Kingdom 
is one of our clients as well.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.120
Is that what brought you to Voldor?

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.660
I figured it was you who gave them the SV-262s.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:39.060
We have a team of mechanics who follow in the footsteps of

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:42.830
the engineers who developed the first 
Variable Fighter during the Unification War.

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:46.590
They have produced a great 
machine, if I may say so myself.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:50.100
You don't happen to be a Windermerean spy, do you?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:55.200
The Windermere Kingdom is a valuable client of ours, but our relationship is strictly a professional one.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:59.290
I actually came here to complete an order that you have placed.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:03.680
I didn't know our suppliers were your affiliates.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:07.620
Why are you so interested about Mikumo?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.800
I doubt you're a fan.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:11.950
Stalker.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.460
Out of personal interest.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.580
The tactical sound unit, Walküre...

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:22.300
Chaos has created a great product indeed.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.300
Product?!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.200
This guy ticks me off.

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.840
During the battle on Voldor the other day,

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:34.620
the Protoculture structure reacted to Mikumo 
Guynemer's singing and was subsequently destroyed.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:39.360
A Siegfried pilot resonated with Freyja Wion's singing,

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.190
temporarily granting him superhuman abilities before going berserk.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:49.410
As I watched such a scene unfold, a particular hypothesis of mine bubbled closer and closer into the realm of certainty.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:52.620
Are you implying you know what happened to them?

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.080
I have a theory.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.750
Please do share.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.840
I have been wondering about this for a long time.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:08.050
Singing might be the ultimate weapon.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:12.370
Weapon?

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.390
Nothing seems to be wrong.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.480
He just needs some rest.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:22.460
I'll leave him in your care.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.350
I shall provide an update later.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.400
Very well.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:26.770
Let's go.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:34.200
That's one thing less to worry about.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:39.210
I wasn't told the experiment on 
Voldor would be that risky.

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:43.170
It seems that I was in too much of a hurry to end the war.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:49.390
The enemy's singing destroyed the structure, and with it, a pillar of the absolute Starwind sector.

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:51.530
It does not affect the bigger picture.

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:53.890
That's why I picked Voldor.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.950
That's not all.

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:58.640
During the battle, something was happening to us too.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:04.760
It felt like something was trying 
to enter me through my rune.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.960
Walküre was singing.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:10.150
Do they have a Wind Singer too?

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.170
That's not the case.

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:16.490
His Majesty's singing is the only means to activate the ruins.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:23.840
The Protoculture gifted only us, 
Windermereans, the song of the wind.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.500
The Protoculture...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.070
1999 AD.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.470
A certain object crashed into the Earth.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.780
The alien starship ASS-1.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:54.800
By investigating ASS-1, the humans of Earth learned that space harbored other sentient lifeforms.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:08:00.730
They analyzed and restored the technology of ASS-1

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:05.180
and developed their own weapons for space combat.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:15.720
In 2009 AD, earthlings came in contact with extraterrestrials for the first time.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:21.680
For a while, terrestrial civilization seemed to be on the path to collapse.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:30.650
However, mankind was saved by a quality particular to them: singing.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:41.510
<i>The men, as if possessed</i>

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:43.570
The entire Zentradi culture revolved around war.

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:47.630
<i>Mouths shut, a flame burning in their eyes</i>

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:47.630
Songs had an immense effect on their minds, which was named the "yack-deculture."

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.630
The Minmay attack.

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:52.340
<i>They all step together</i>

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:52.340
Minmay as in Lynn Minmay?

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:54.930
Everyone knows that.

00:08:54.150 --> 00:09:04.600
<i>I fear I will be left behind again</i>

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:58.570
They even turned it into a galaxy channel drama series.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.390
The Lynn Minmay Files. Recorded every episode.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:04.600
What's that gotta do with Hayate and Mikumo?

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:07.340
Please, all will be clear once I finish.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:09.250
<i>As they march to war...</i>

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:11.570
At that point, it was thought to be a mere culture shock.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:14.460
But is that really the case?

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:19.740
What if music itself had some power?

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:20.530
Power?

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.110
Indeed.

00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:29.750
There have been other high-
profile incidents involving music.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:34.510
<i>An tagk chsutw dofie le</i>

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:37.260
The AI-driven virtual idol Sharon 
Apple became self-aware

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:37.260
<i>E dju san</i>

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:44.630
<i>Zdu zdi ouga so Momenty qu e</i>

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:44.130
and tried to brainwash and control the capital of Earth, Macross City, with its beautiful singing

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:47.640
in what came to be known as the Sharon Apple Incident.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:50.410
<i>Fly away! Fly away!</i>

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:55.580
In 2045 AD, the colonization fleet 
with Macross 7 at its center

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:53.450
<i>Let's climb ever higher</i>

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:56.020
<i>Try again! Try again!</i>

00:09:55.580 --> 00:10:01.950
came under attack by mysterious creatures that fed on the life energy of humans.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:59.060
<i>Wave goodbye to yesterday</i>

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.950
<i>Fly away! Fly away!</i>

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:09.420
This time, a special ops unit called Sound Force was formed and fought them off utilizing music.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:05.350
<i>Just keep believing</i>

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:07.500
<i>Try again! Try again!</i>

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:11.130
<i>The sun will surely rise again</i>

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.130
Fire Bomber...

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.390
Ah, that is correct.

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:19.070
If I recall correctly, your grandparents were the captain and mayor of Macross 7,

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:25.770
and your aunt was a member 
of Sound Force and Fire Bomber.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.770
Isn't that right, First Lt. Mirage Farina Jenius?

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:33.400
Then eight years ago, the Vajra War.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:39.330
The Vajra are a collective life form connected through

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:44.160
a hyperspace network they create in 
symbiosis with the fold bacteria they host.

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:51.280
In 2059 AD, the Macross Frontier fleet came in contact with the Vajra,

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.540
and war erupted.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:11:00.380
However, it eventually became clear that they react to singers who also host fold bacteria,

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:03.470
<i>It's not certain for you to protect the key to the door</i>

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:01.590
and contact was established.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:07.800
The Vajra understood that humans are an advanced intelligent life form and not an enemy.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.210
<i>Even if he tastes an embarrassing story</i>

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:13.270
<i>The lion is strong</i>

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:12.190
To avoid further conflict, the Vajra departed to another dimension.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:22.090
When the Vajra left our dimension, a number of the fold bacteria they hosted were left behind.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.030
<i>I want to survive</i>

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:16.610
<i>I still want to live</i>

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.120
<i>I love you</i>

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:24.070
<i>Until I show you my serious feelings</i>

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:27.340
They folded themselves and sought new hosts.

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:31.670
<i>I won't sleep</i>

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:30.700
Those new hosts happened to be humanoids.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.810
While before they only lived in the intestines,

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:35.470
now they occasionally infest cell nuclei as well.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:37.130
This results in what we know as...

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:39.590
The Var syndrome.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:46.260
I see Chaos was aware of that much as well.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:50.540
I had no idea the Var Syndrome 
and the Vajra were related!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:55.230
Only high-ranking officers were told, since it's only still just a theory.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.360
That's discrimination.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:06.380
Fold bacteria react to strong emotions and emit them as telepathic waves.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:10.280
Those affected lose control of their emotions and reason,

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.870
reverting them into a violent mob.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:19.360
At the same time, people with a natural immunity to fold bacteria appeared.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:22.840
That would be you, the members of Walküre.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.430
You have fold receptors.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.850
The UN Government does not make it public,

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:38.180
but the number of people with fold 
receptors is rising across the galaxy.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:43.240
However, their strength varies by the person.

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:43.240
<i>We never know what the future will bring</i>

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:47.790
The condition for receptor bearers 
to generate bio-fold waves

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:47.740
<i>We just believe that there's a silver lining</i>

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:51.540
<i>There's no need to fear and one thing to do</i>

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:51.490
appears to be a powerful activation of vital signals.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:54.830
In other words, their lives must be in danger.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:55.540
<i>Overcome all difficulties we face</i>

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:59.590
<i>Sadness is a trap</i>

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.590
When your lives are at risk and your minds are excited,

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:02.340
the emitted fold waves grow ever stronger.

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:03.970
<i>Morning wanders in with secrets</i>

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:09.130
At this point after various experiments, singing while risking one's life appears to be the most effective.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:07.680
<i>The flowers are wet with tears</i>

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:12.620
<i>Ordeals aren't restricted by logic</i>

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:17.260
The music of Walküre is a power they acquired through fold bacteria and receptors.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:21.250
<i>We just follow our instincts and do our best</i>

00:13:17.260 --> 00:13:20.360
It is fundamentally different from our song of the wind.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:28.530
We are born with fold quartz and receptors in our runes, though they are weak.

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:33.440
This is the proof that we are the 
true heirs of the Protoculture.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:37.250
Furthermore, His Majesty is the 
descendant of the legendary Star Singer.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:43.530
Windermereans are the ultimate humanoids.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:47.950
His Majesty might eventually become the king of the Protoculture.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.810
He might transcend from the Wind Singer to the Star Singer.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.450
But why music?

00:13:57.450 --> 00:14:02.610
I keep wondering if that was also 
planned by the Protoculture.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:09.530
The song that earthlings used during Space War I

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.130
turned out to be a hit from 500,000 years ago.

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:17.470
It appears that the Protoculture enjoyed music as well.

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:21.950
However, their focus eventually shifted to music's effects on the mind

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:25.280
and its potential as a weapon.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.840
<i>I can hear your voice now</i>

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.490
<i>Telling me "come here now"</i>

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:36.490
The Protoculture gave rise to a number of humanoid races we see today.

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:40.040
<i>As I was about to lose to loneliness</i>

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:41.360
What if they inserted some code 
related to music into our DNA?

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:46.860
What if music is a weapon created by the Protoculture to interfere with our minds?

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:48.620
<i>I can see you now</i>

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:49.370
That's horrible...

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:51.250
<i>Walking towards me</i>

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:53.360
Music allows you to put others under your 
control while making them feel good about it,

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:58.040
<i>As I'm waiting, eyes closed</i>

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:57.930
and also without any deaths or 
collateral damage to the environment.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:02.880
What if you could influence the hearts of many at once?

00:15:02.270 --> 00:15:08.820
<i>Yesterday my heart was clouded with tears</i>

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:09.510
What if it was not only a mental influence, but also granting them powers even beyond that?

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:19.100
<i>But now...</i>

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:20.100
When you resonated with Second Lt. Hayate Immelmann,

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:27.470
<i>Do you remember when our eyes first met?</i>

00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:24.500
and when Mikumo Guynemer resonated with the Protoculture structures,

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:28.030
you displayed the full extent of your capabilities.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:35.990
<i>Do you remember when our hands first touched?</i>

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:34.420
That Windermerean girl is generating bio-fold waves a lot stronger than the average.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:38.560
However, the nature of the one 
called Mikumo is again different.

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:45.150
<i>That was when the journey of our love began</i>

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.420
Not to mention she is progressing at an alarming rate.

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.710
I suspect it was her voice that interfered with the systems

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:50.510
<i>I love you so</i>

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.660
and delivered some kind of a shock to His Majesty.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:53.950
The anomaly you felt was probably the immense bio-fold waves

00:15:53.950 --> 00:16:00.190
caused by the overlapping singing of His Majesty and those women.

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.020
So you couldn't predict it either?

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:09.180
The Protoculture built those structures 500,000 years ago

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.400
to suppress the threat of the Zentradi.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:15.650
We have yet to discover all of their capabilities.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:16.580
I was careless.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.580
I apologize.

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.540
There are many more things in this galaxy beyond my...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:30.270
Nay, beyond humanoid comprehension.

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:34.440
Our lives are too short to uncover it all.

00:16:35.750 --> 00:16:37.430
Don't you think it's unfair?

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.390
I don't care about the galaxy.

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:46.520
The skies of Windermere are enough for me.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:49.230
You would say that.

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:59.240
These skies are enough, huh?

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:00.450
No!

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.750
Music isn't a weapon!

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:03.880
Freyja!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:11.500
When Hayate Immelmann reacted to your 
singing, he displayed overwhelming power.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:13.920
What is that if not a weapon?

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:19.680
Your singing amplified his sensory, mental, and physical capabilities,

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.420
pushing him near his absolute limits.

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:28.060
Our analysis suggests it was beyond anything the Var is capable of.

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:31.320
You are a Windermerean.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.190
You are born with receptors,

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.950
so even though you lost control of yourself, you emerged unhurt.

00:17:38.460 --> 00:17:43.330
However, it is certain that your singing accelerated him.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.460
Cut it out!

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:50.790
I have heard certain rumors.

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:54.200
Since the end of Space War I,

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:59.770
Lady M of Chaos has been researching the power of music

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:03.290
and that she is involved in developing an ultimate weapon

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:07.560
that would allow utilizing the power of music to its fullest.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.530
An ultimate weapon...

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:10.270
For real?

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:16.280
Some suggest it is a living weapon created through gene manipulation, while others claim it is an android.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:20.120
Are you implying it's Kumo-Kumo?

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:22.700
It is but mere rumors. Rumors.

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:25.040
Mikumo's one of us!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.120
Yes, of course.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:29.760
But...

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:30.920
Enough is enough!

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:33.840
Pardon me.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.810
The cargo has been unloaded.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.370
If you would excuse me now.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:42.430
You're just gonna let him go?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.880
He's with the Windermereans!

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:45.890
Contain yourself!

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:48.590
I am but a simple merchant.

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:53.200
We have proper permission to handle arms and ammunition

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.610
from the UN Government.

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.850
That is correct.

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:02.070
However, our business relationship ends here.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.680
That is most regrettable.

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:07.350
Do contact us if you have a change of heart.

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:09.000
Excuse me.

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:24.390
<i>I was careless.</i>

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.430
<i>I apologize.</i>

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.620
Careless?

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.140
Who's there?

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:32.770
Wh-White Knight, sir.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:36.650
It's you? Did something happen to His Majesty?

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:40.690
I can't... It's such a dreadful thing...

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:41.990
What are you talking about?

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.240
His Majesty... King Gramia's...

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.620
Please excuse me.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:00.340
Hayate...

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.990
You sure have it easy.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:09.000
Things are a total mess.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:13.800
Mikumo's still unconscious and some weird guy showed up too.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:14.920
Freyja's...

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:21.030
I don't know... what I'm supposed to say to her.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:25.460
It's not even about Freyja.

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:28.600
I just don't know what I'm supposed to do.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:31.890
Flying is all I know.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:33.620
Why won't you...

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:38.610
wake up when we need you the most?

00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:43.330
You should be taking off with a blast like you always do.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:46.080
You should be talking back rudely like you always do.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.100
Just be around like always...

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:53.690
Just be around me...

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.170
Just be with me...

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:04.820
Oh, shut up.

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:12.870
H-How long have you been awake?

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:17.960
I had a dream where my mom was scolding me.

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:21.880
Are you feeling okay?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.080
Yeah. Sorry.

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:25.180
You should stay in bed!

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.760
Looks like I made you worry.

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:31.350
Don't worry about it.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.930
Thanks, Mirage.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:48.710
Hayate...

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:55.790
Mikumo, just who are you?

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:16.690
<i>The stars are aligning, an occasion once in 30 years</i>

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:23.810
<i>I don't want to sleep, just sitting next to you</i>

00:22:23.810 --> 00:22:27.950
<i>and see how things work out</i>

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:37.190
<i>I can feel the wheels turning little by little</i>

00:22:37.190 --> 00:22:39.750
<i>(Can you hear my heart?)</i>

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:44.230
<i>A year? A day? A moment?</i>

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:52.570
<i>I've never considered what those even mean</i>

00:22:54.420 --> 00:22:55.980
<i>Don't tell me now</i>

00:22:55.980 --> 00:23:03.140
<i>When the falling stars are coming, I don't wanna know</i>

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>(Hey, I'm alive here and now)</i>

00:23:06.110 --> 00:23:07.700
<i>Don't tell me now</i>

00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:14.550
<i>Because I don't want regrets if this is the end</i>

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:17.750
<i>(Hey, we're here right now)</i>

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:27.170
<i>Then the wind starts blowing with no warning</i>

00:23:36.890 --> 00:23:39.980
Next time: Impulse Experiment
